2026!","summary":"TEKNOKRAT is a part of Steam's Cyberpunk Fest 2026! Join us in celebrating awesome cyborg media by trying the free demo of our sci-fi thriller romance visual novel!You have been branded as unemployed, and rely on the state to survive. Until you are assigned a temporary position at a cyborg repair workshop, giving you a shot at gaining freedom.But when strange glitches start happening to your eye implants, you find yourself thrust into a plan far beyond your comprehension, tying your fate to one ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T12:46:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055894695","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3732260-1831432155578386","game_id":"steam-3732260","kind":"announcement","title":"11th-18th of May - Games Of Norway Festival!","summary":"From the 11th to the 18th of May, tune in to the Games Of Norway festival on Steam! TEKNOKRAT is joining 150+ other Norwegian titles for this massive event featuring past, present and future releases, saucy sales and gameplay streams! Learn more at gamesofnorway.com","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T18:47:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155578386","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3732260-1825093633188913","game_id":"steam-3732260","kind":"announcement","title":"NEWS! Popularity poll winner art, reviews open & soundtrack upload!","summary":"Hey again everyone, and thank you so much for your votes in the TEKNOKRAT love interest popularity poll! As promised, here is the artwork of our lovely winner Bane, who won with 46% of the vote! Help like-minded players find TEKNOKRAT!We finally managed to figure out how to open the demo up to reviews! If you enjoyed our demo, we would really appreciate it if you took a moment to write us a review. A review helps us become more visible, and also helps players see if TEKNOKRAT is right for them! ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T19:59:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633188913","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3732260-1822556746165816","game_id":"steam-3732260","kind":"announcement","title":"POPULARITY POLL RESULTS ARE IN!","summary":"UPDATE: The poll is now closed! Thank you for voting for your favorites! Stay tuned for the winning artwork in a future news update :3Its time for a POPULARITY POLL! 🗳️ Have you been having fun playing our game? Who's your favorite so far? 👀 Vote through the QR code or with the link below - the poll closes on the 8th of February! ...Winning candidate receives special artwork 😳 Thank you so much for playing our demo!-Vertebrae Entertainment","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-25T19:21:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746165816","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3732260-1822556746162441","game_id":"steam-3732260","kind":"announcement","title":"STEAM DEMO is LIVE!","summary":"The demo is finally here, and ready to be played! We hope you enjoy our game.Thank you so much for supporting this project! We're excited to bring you even more as we work towards the full release :3-Vertebrae Entertainment","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-23T17:16:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746162441","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3732260-1821922921818229","game_id":"steam-3732260","kind":"announcement","title":"TEKNOKRAT demo coming January 23rd!","summary":"Hi everybody! Thank you for the interest and patience while we've been cooking up hot cyborg situations.We're very excited to announce that the wait is almost over! The Steam demo is coming next Friday, on January 23rd! Please look forward to:Being introduced to our three cyborg love interests13k words worth of techno-dystopian readingExploring the insides of your cyborg clients (strictly professionally, of course)CG gallery featuring 7 different CGsAudio player with 11 original tracksJimmy.The ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-17T15:47:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921818229","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3732260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3732260":"2026-10-26T00:44:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3732260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"3976970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3732260","app_id":3732260,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"60b6d7e3d27b009abbe94d4961c078e71299fc27ab2fbd2e43da16df